OL,3,GNEWSAFunding plea as extreme weather
OL,4,Astrains fire crews
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe level of funding given to fire and
OL,7,Frescue services does not reflect the
OL,8,Frole they play in the nation's
OL,9,Fresilience, firefighters in Cornwall
OL,10,Fhave said.
OL,12,FThey cited the increasing demands on
OL,13,Ffirefighters of having to respond to
OL,14,Fextreme weather events this year,
OL,15,Fincluding storms and wildfires.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
