OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F343A1793620576
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAFunding plea as extreme weather
OL,4,Astrains fire crews
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Fire Brigades Union (FBU) warned
OL,7,Freliance in Cornwall on retained
OL,8,Ffirefighters was not sustainable and
OL,9,Fthe system was beginning to feel the
OL,10,Fpressure of increased demand, with fire
OL,11,Fchief Kathryn Billing revealing about
OL,12,Fhalf the brigade responded to Storm
OL,13,FAusten.
OL,15,FThe government said it was investing
OL,16,Fabout #2bn in fire services and another
OL,17,F#45m into new equipment to help crews
OL,18,Fdeal with wildfires.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
